export anchor StickerSheetStyle:
    number: 111
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Sticker sheet
    idea: The dashboard is a sheet of glossy die-cut stickers with thick white borders on a pale backing, each number, project and chart bar its own sticker, slightly tilted as if just placed.
    base: light
    palette:
        backing: #e8edf2, the page behind the sheet, with faint diagonal lines
        sheet: #f6f8fa, the sticker sheet card
        dieCutWhite: #ffffff, sticker borders, chips, the chart card and fields
        yellow: #ffd23f, the current nav and a sticker fill
        pink: #ff8fb1, this week bars and a sticker fill
        mint: #6fd6a8, the bell and a sticker fill
        sky: #7cc6fe, the greeting and last week bars
        lilac: #c3a6ff, a sticker fill
        orange: #ff9f5a, a sticker fill
        violet: #5b3fd1, the primary button and the focus ring, white text
        ink: #1a1a2e, all text on stickers and the progress fill
        green: #0f7a4a, the On track chip
        amber: #9a5b00, the At risk chip
        red: #b3261e, the Behind chip, the overdue burst and the count badge
    type:
        One stack, Avenir Next, Segoe UI, system-ui, Roboto, at heavy
        weights with tight tracking. The greeting is 44px 900 at 1.02,
        numbers 48px 900, section titles 24px 900, sticker titles 19px 800,
        percents 26px 900, body 15px at 1.45, chips 13px 800.
    layout:
        A large rounded sheet card sits on the backing with a perforated
        strip along its top and a tiny caps line Sheet 31 Peel and plan.
        The header is a tilted white pill sticker brand with a star, a white
        search pill, a violet New project pill, a round mint bell sticker
        with a red count and a round pink MO sticker. The nav is white pills,
        the current one a yellow sticker tilted and lifted. The greeting is
        a big sky sticker, Hey Mara!, the date and a red starburst sticker
        with 4 tasks are overdue. Beside it the numbers are four stickers of
        different shapes, a yellow circle, a mint rounded square, a pink
        pill and a lilac leaf shape, each tilted. Projects are six coloured
        rounded stickers three across with name, meta, a chunky ink progress
        pill, the big percent and a white status chip, and the Billing
        migration sticker has a peeling top right corner. The chart is a
        white card where each day is a pill sticker bar with a gloss spot,
        sky for last week and pink for this week. Just stuck on lists the
        activity with round initial stickers. Below 1000px sections stack,
        below 640px stickers go one across.
    spacing: An 8px unit with wide 24 to 32px gutters so each sticker has room for its white border.
    density: Low to medium. Big type, three stickers across.
    corners: Round. 20 to 28px on stickers, full pills for nav, buttons and chart bars, and one circle sticker.
    borders: A 5 to 6px white die-cut border drawn as a spread shadow. Dashed kiss-cut lines on the backing.
    shadows: A soft 8px lift under every sticker, plus a diagonal gloss highlight across the top left of each.
    icons:
        Filled sticker shapes at 22px. A ticked circle for On track, a
        rounded triangle for At risk, a rounded square with a bar for
        Behind and a red starburst with a mark for overdue, on a white chip
        with the word.
    focus: A 3px violet outline offset 4px, outside the white sticker border.
    tone: Bubbly, such as Hey Mara and Just stuck on.
